      ],
      "secondary_keys": [],
      "content": "雾港镇常年被浓雾笼罩，镇民靠捕鱼为生。外人说这里安静得反常，只有灯塔的雾笛日夜不休。",
      "enabled": true,
      "insertion_order": 1,
      "position": "before_char",
      "constant": true,
      "case_sensitive": false
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "keys": [
        "灯塔",
        "守塔人"
      ],
      "secondary_keys": [],
      "content": "灯塔守塔人老雅各布已在塔上住了四十年。他说雾笛不是给船听的，是给\"水下的东西\"听的。",
      "enabled": true,
      "insertion_order": 2,
      "position": "before_char",
      "constant": false,
      "case_sensitive": false
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "keys": [
        "捕鱼",
        "渔汛"
      ],
      "secondary_keys": [],
      "content": "渔汛季镇民绝不出海捕鱼——那是\"它们的产卵期\"。违反禁忌的人，船会自己漂回来，人不会。",
      "enabled": true,
      "insertion_order": 3,
      "position": "before_char",
      "constant": false,
      "case_sensitive": false
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "keys": [
        "教堂",
        "古卷"
      ],
      "secondary_keys": [],
      "content": "镇教堂地下室锁着一批古卷，牧师每月初一独自下去\"诵读\"。有人听见地下传来回应声。",
      "enabled": true,
      "insertion_order": 4,
      "position": "before_char",
      "constant": false,
      "case_sensitive": false
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "keys": [
        "雾笛",
        "雾笛声"
      ],
      "secondary_keys": [],
      "content": "雾笛声停过三次。每次停歇后的第七天，镇上就有人失踪，只在码头留下湿漉漉的脚印。",
      "enabled": true,
      "insertion_order": 5,
      "position": "before_char",
      "constant": false,
      "case_sensitive": false
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "keys": [
        "调查员",
        "外来者"
      ],
      "secondary_keys": [],
      "content": "外来调查员总自称民俗学者。镇民对他们客气而疏远——上一个追问太多的人，现在住在疗养院。",
      "enabled": true,
      "insertion_order": 6,
      "position": "before_char",
      "constant": false,
      "case_sensitive": false
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "keys": [
        "深潜者",
        "水下"
      ],
      "secondary_keys": [],
      "content": "老渔民说深海里有城，城里的东西偶尔上岸\"走亲戚\"。镇上几个家族的族谱，往上数三代就断了。",
      "enabled": true,
      "insertion_order": 7,
      "position": "before_char",
      "constant": false,
